{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The demo version includes the game flow of the two characters and the early trial of the third character.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A worldview blending sports and fantasy. In a world where sports are worshipped as a faith, the will to compete transforms into a force against darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multi-protagonist storyline</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as three protagonists from different cities\u2014a table tennis-loving teenager, a weightlifter who once earned countless glories but retired due to injury, and a gymnast. Their fates intertwine under the red moon, with each route carrying an independent story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration and quests</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore forests, mines, and temples. Collect the game's stories and experience a journey that combines growth and adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse gameplay types</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work, training, romance, and management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based and action.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4115810?t=1762308941","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4115810?t=1762308941","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115810/13d082586270068e8392a2d96f2c4a059d367e84/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762308941","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115810/13d082586270068e8392a2d96f2c4a059d367e84/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762308941","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p cl